The Apache License 2.0 in the LICENSE file covers this project's own source code.

RdpTabs.ico is not covered by it. That file is a byte-for-byte copy of the
RT_GROUP_ICON / RT_ICON resources of Microsoft's mstsc.exe (Remote Desktop
Connection), so the application shows the Remote Desktop icon Windows users
already recognise. The artwork remains Microsoft's. Replace it if you
redistribute a modified build under your own name or branding.

RdpTabs contains no Microsoft source code. It drives the Remote Desktop ActiveX
control (mstscax.dll) that ships with Windows through its public COM interfaces,
the same component the built-in mstsc client uses.
